==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schif}}, from {{inh|de|goh|skif}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skipą}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with Low German {{m|nds|Schipp}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|skip}}, Dutch {{m|nl|schip}}, Yiddish {{m|yi|שיף|tr=shif}}, English {{m|en|ship}}, Danish {{m|da|skib}}, Swedish {{m|sv|skepp}}. Related also to Lithuanian {{m|lt|skiẽbti||to rip up}}, Latvian {{m|lv|skibit|škibît|to cut, lop}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

